{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005b","title":"刘备从邹靖讨黄巾并任安熹尉","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"黄巾起事后，刘备率属众随邹靖征讨，有功而任安熹尉。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"从军任官","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0015","role":"领军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"安熹","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]},"time":{"year":184,"label":"灵帝末黄巾起","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y184","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o005","basis":"灵帝末黄巾起"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q","xianzhu-q-o005","wudi-q-o004","wudi-q-b-0b46b06245df0636b76c"]},"source_order":[32,20,"O005b"],"order":6497}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0015","name":"邹靖","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o005"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o005-xianzhu-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o005"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-0b46b06245df0636b76c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0b46b06245df0636b76c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗光和：东汉灵帝的年号。光和末是公元 184 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-457d2e030e6e5be8f05a","start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o004","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4a52cf5e3cf71b97de6","layer":"original","quote":"光和末〖1〗，黄巾起〖2〗；拜骑都尉〖3〗，讨颍川贼〖4〗。迁为济南相〖5〗，国有十余县，长吏多阿附贵戚〖6〗，赃污狼藉；于是奏免其八〔九〕。禁断淫祀〖7〗，奸宄逃窜〖8〗，郡界肃然。﹝一﹞久之，征还为东郡太守〖9〗；不就，称疾归乡里。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8d72564c7b9f62ba311c","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝末，黄巾起，州郡各举义兵。先主率其属，从校尉邹靖讨黄巾贼；有功，除安（喜）〔熹〕尉〖4〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o005","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8d72564c7b9f62ba311c","layer":"original","quote":"中山大商张世平、苏双等赀累千金〖3〗，贩马周旋于涿郡；见而异之，乃多与之金财。先主由是得用合徒众。灵帝末，黄巾起，州郡各举义兵。先主率其属，从校尉邹靖讨黄巾贼；有功，除安（喜）〔熹〕尉〖4〗。﹝一﹞督邮以公事到县，先主求谒，不通；直入缚督邮，杖二百；解绶系其颈着马枊〖5〗，﹝二﹞弃官亡命。﹝三﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
